# Security Policy

## Supported Versions

We actively maintain and support the core codebase of the training tool.

| Version | Supported          |
| ------- | ------------------ |
| 1.0.x   | ✅ Supported       |

## Reporting a Vulnerability

Security is paramount to the Waleedunslaw Cybersecurity Organization. If you discover a vulnerability or security flaw within the application framework, please report it immediately:

1. Do not open a public GitHub issue for security flaws.
2. Email your findings directly to the operations team or project maintainer.
3. Provide a clear description, reproduction steps, and potential remediation approaches where applicable.

We will review all reports promptly and address verified vulnerabilities in subsequent builds.
